FLEET_REAP_HUB_WAIT                knob: seconds dash-reap.sh waits on a remote reap via the hub (90; #1589)
FLEET_REAP_LOCAL                   handoff: the node adapter tells dash-reap.sh never to ask the hub (#1589)
